{"logId": "62225569-7f36-43fa-a3db-dd323c11e2eb", "result": {"layoutParsingResults": [{"prunedResult": {"page_count": null, "width": 1190, "height": 1684, "model_settings": {"use_doc_preprocessor": false, "use_layout_detection": true, "use_chart_recognition": false, "use_seal_recognition": false, "use_ocr_for_image_block": false, "format_block_content": false, "merge_layout_blocks": true, "markdown_ignore_labels": ["number", "footnote", "header", "header_image", "footer", "footer_image", "aside_text"], "return_layout_polygon_points": true}, "parsing_res_list": [{"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "考评奖励标准——家庭（孩子）", "block_bbox": [170, 140, 561, 173], "block_id": 0, "block_order": 1, "group_id": 0, "block_polygon_points": [[170.0, 140.0], [561.0, 140.0], [561.0, 173.0], [170.0, 173.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "一级【0~1分】：不因错误的教育惯性或方式，对孩子造成困扰或伤害。（底线原则）", "block_bbox": [163, 215, 862, 240], "block_id": 1, "block_order": 2, "group_id": 1, "block_polygon_points": [[163.0, 215.0], [862.0, 215.0], [862.0, 240.0], [163.0, 240.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "- 本条释义：在养育孩子的过程中，因为不成熟的思想和教育观念，往往会给孩子带来很不健康的影响甚至是不被理解、造成心理伤害的后果。", "block_bbox": [164, 261, 1005, 316], "block_id": 2, "block_order": 3, "group_id": 2, "block_polygon_points": [[164.0, 261.0], [1005.0, 261.0], [1005.0, 316.0], [164.0, 316.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "- 不符合的行为：", "block_bbox": [166, 359, 301, 381], "block_id": 3, "block_order": 4, "group_id": 3, "block_polygon_points": [[166.0, 359.0], [300.0, 359.0], [300.0, 380.0], [166.0, 380.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "1、打骂孩子", "block_bbox": [182, 398, 291, 421], "block_id": 4, "block_order": 5, "group_id": 4, "block_polygon_points": [[182.0, 398.0], [290.0, 398.0], [290.0, 420.0], [182.0, 420.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "2、重男轻女、传宗接代、养儿防老等的思想观念和行为\n3、以成绩为导向评价和教育孩子，孩子分数不好时批评、否定、指责\n4、父母“自我牺牲”式的付出，让孩子背负沉重的压力、责任、束缚等\n（1）经常用“都是为了你好”“要不是为了你”“我辛辛苦苦把你养大”等语言教育孩子\n（2）总是强调或凸显父母如何辛苦、如何付出，为了让孩子争气、努力\n5、伤害孩子自尊心、自信心的行为\n（1）在人前暴露或批评孩子的缺点\n（2）经常拿孩子和他人对比", "block_bbox": [180, 424, 899, 655], "block_id": 5, "block_order": 6, "group_id": 5, "block_polygon_points": [[180.0, 424.0], [899.0, 424.0], [899.0, 655.0], [180.0, 655.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "[62]", "block_bbox": [573, 716, 612, 738], "block_id": 6, "block_order": 7, "group_id": 6, "block_polygon_points": [[573.0, 716.0], [611.0, 716.0], [611.0, 737.0], [573.0, 737.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "考评奖励标准——家庭（孩子）", "block_bbox": [207, 900, 596, 933], "block_id": 7, "block_order": 8, "group_id": 7, "block_polygon_points": [[207.0, 900.0], [596.0, 900.0], [596.0, 933.0], [207.0, 933.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "（3）未经孩子允许，把孩子的东西送给他人\n\n6、把自己的意愿强加给孩子\n\n（1）违背孩子兴趣和意愿，强行要求上兴趣班等\n\n（2）因干涉子女选择学校、专业、职业而造成冲突或伤害\n\n（3）干涉成年子女自由恋爱和婚姻，或以挑剔、恶劣的态度对待孩子的恋爱对象\n\n7、因为早恋而指责、反对、打击孩子\n\n8、过分追问私人问题、翻看孩子日记、窥探孩子隐私等\n\n9、离异时把孩子当成包袱、累赘，拒绝养孩子\n\n10、离异家庭，给孩子传导对方不好或过错，让孩子厌恶甚至憎恨对方，形成更深的误解和伤", "block_bbox": [215, 979, 951, 1238], "block_id": 8, "block_order": 9, "group_id": 8, "block_polygon_points": [[215.0, 979.0], [951.0, 979.0], [951.0, 1238.0], [215.0, 1238.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "11、因缺乏对孩子的教育或给予不良教育，造成孩子严重的抑郁、性格缺陷或精神类疾病", "block_bbox": [220, 1236, 930, 1260], "block_id": 9, "block_order": 10, "group_id": 9, "block_polygon_points": [[220.0, 1236.0], [930.0, 1236.0], [930.0, 1260.0], [220.0, 1260.0]]}, {"block_label": "number", "block_content": "[63]", "block_bbox": [611, 1476, 650, 1498], "block_id": 10, "block_order": null, "group_id": 10, "block_polygon_points": [[611.0, 1476.0], [649.0, 1476.0], [649.0, 1497.0], [611.0, 1497.0]]}], "layout_det_res": {"boxes": [{"cls_id": 17, "label": "paragraph_title", "score": 0.7629618048667908, "coordinate": [170, 140, 561, 173], "order": 1, "polygon_points": [[170.0, 140.0], [561.0, 140.0], [561.0, 173.0], [170.0, 173.0]]}, {"cls_id": 17, "label": "paragraph_title